    m\u1EA1ng nh\u1ECF c\xF3 hai tuy\u1EBFn: \xEDt g\xF3c nh\u01B0ng c\u1EA7n c\u0103n
    h\u01A1n, ho\u1EB7c nhi\u1EC1u g\xF3c r\u1ED9ng h\u01A1n.\nRecovery: Hai nh\xE1nh
    c\xF3 \u0111i\u1EC3m \u0111\u1ED5i \xFD v\xE0 quay v\u1EC1 n\xFAt chung; kh\xF4ng
    nh\xE1nh n\xE0o tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh b\u1EABy sau khi \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn"
